---
import HotelList from "../components/practical-info/hotels/HotelList.astro";
import Hotel from "../components/practical-info/hotels/Hotel.astro";
import CommonLayout from "../layouts/CommonLayout.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import OneColumn from "../components/OneColumn.astro";
---

<CommonLayout
  title="Hotels for All-Hands Attendees"
  header="Hotels for All-Hands Attendees"
  withLogo
>
  <Hero title="Hotels for All-Hands Attendees" color="yellow" />

  <OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
      <p>
        We have reserved blocks of rooms at a three hotels to ensure
        availability for the All-Hands participants. Breakfast included and
        flexible cancellation.
      </p>
      <p>
        Rooms are reserved from Sun May 17 to Sun May 24. If you plan to arrive before the 17th or depart after the 24th you can reach out to the hotel to extend your stay, see the hotel's booking page for contact details. There is a minimum of 3 of 4 nights, depending of the hotel's terms. 
      </p>
      <p>
        The Moxy, Hampton by Hilton, and HolidayInn links below will take you to
        custom booking page created for RustWeek.
      </p>
      <p>
        At 2L De Blend we don't have a reserved blocks of rooms, but as long as
        there is availability you can use a discount code to get a studio at a
        reasonable price.
      </p>
      <p>
        The distances mentioned on this page refer to the shortest path when
        walking and/or making use of public transport.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you're looking for more hotel options, have a look at our <a
          href="/hotels">other hotel recommendations</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>
  </OneColumn>

  <HotelList>
    <Hotel
      name="2L De Blend"
      link="https://2ldeblend.nl/"
      image="deblend.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="22 min"
      price_range="~€150 (studio)"
      description="Hotel with studios and suites with a fully equipped kitchen. More affordable prices. Close to both conference and All-Hands venue. Apply <strong>'RustWeek2026'</strong> for a 20% discount on studios."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Holiday Inn Express"
      link="https://www.ihg.com/redirect?path=rates&brandCode=EX&localeCode=en&regionCode=1&hotelCode=AMSUT&checkInDate=17&checkInMonthYear=042026&checkOutDate=24&checkOutMonthYear=042026&_PMID=99801505&GPC=ONL&cn=no&adjustMonth=false&showApp=true&monthIndex=00"
      image="holiday-inn-express-utrecht.jpg"
      distance_kinepolis="25 min"
      price_range="€123-€145"
      description="Reasonably priced hotel, 25 min from the conference venue (walk + ~ 10 min bus) or a 15-min bike ride. 35 rooms reserved."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Moxy Utrecht"
      link="https://app.marriott.com/reslink?id=1762352977355&key=GRP&app=resvlink"
      image="moxy.avif"
      distance_kinepolis="13 min"
      price_range="€202"
      description="A trendy hotel with a modern vibe. Provides meeting rooms, co-working facilities and a bar. 35 rooms reserved."
    />
    <Hotel
      name="Hampton by Hilton"
      link="https://www.hilton.com/en/book/reservation/rooms/?ctyhocn=AMSUNHX&arrivalDate=2026-05-17&departureDate=2026-05-24&groupCode=CHHONL&room1NumAdults=1&cid=OM%2CWW%2CHILTONLINK%2CEN%2CDirectLink"
      image="hilton.jpeg"
      distance_kinepolis="13 min"
      price_range="~ €240"
      description="Modern hotel very close to the central station of Utrecht. 10 min walk to the conference venue. Part of the Hoog Caterijne shopping complex. 20 rooms reserved."
    />
  </HotelList>
</CommonLayout>
